    IDS_MSG_21078    "Your next promotion is contingent on the return of"
    IDS_MSG_21079    "the Regalia of the Demon Emperor."
    IDS_MSG_21080    "The Demon Emperor holds court at the base of a volcano"
    IDS_MSG_21081    "to the far south, in the heart of a swamp."
    IDS_MSG_21082    "You have been taught the spell of heroism!"
    IDS_MSG_21083    "You are given advanced training, and a raise."
    IDS_MSG_21084    "You are now a Legion Force-Leader!"
    IDS_MSG_21085    "You receive more training, and bonus pay."
    IDS_MSG_21086    "You are promoted to Legion Centurion!"
    IDS_MSG_21087    "You get advanced training, and a higher salary."
    IDS_MSG_21088    "You can't possibly enter the castle, you nobody!"
    IDS_MSG_21089    "Come back when you are famous."
    IDS_MSG_21090    "You are ushered into the castle."
    IDS_MSG_21091    "His Grace, "
    IDS_MSG_21092    "-- Duke of Rampart! <fanfare>"
    IDS_MSG_21093    "Well, sirrah, wouldst embark on a quest? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21094    "Splendid. Bring me the head of the Goblin King."
    IDS_MSG_21095    "You scoundrel! Guards! Take this blackguard away!"
    IDS_MSG_21096    "Good job, sirrah! I promote you to the rank of esquire."
    IDS_MSG_21097    "Now that you have proved yourself true, another quest!"
    IDS_MSG_21098    "Bring to me a Holy Defender!"
    IDS_MSG_21099    "One is said to be in the possession of the Great Wyrm"
    IDS_MSG_21100    "in the depths of the sewers below the city."
    IDS_MSG_21101    "Do not return until you achieve the quest, caitiff!"
    IDS_MSG_21102    "My thanks, squire. In return, I dub thee knight!"
    IDS_MSG_21103    "If thou wouldst please me further..."
    IDS_MSG_21104    "Bring me a suit of dragonscale armor."
    IDS_MSG_21105    "You might have to kill a dragon to get one...."
    IDS_MSG_21106    "Greetings, squire. My sword? What, you don't have it?"
    IDS_MSG_21107    "Thanks, good sir knight."
    IDS_MSG_21108    "Here are letters patent to a peerage!"
    IDS_MSG_21109    "If you would do me a final service..."
    IDS_MSG_21110    "I require the Orb of Mastery. If you would be so kind..."
    IDS_MSG_21111    "By the way, you might find the Orb in the possession"
    IDS_MSG_21112    "Of the Elemental Master on the Astral Plane"
    IDS_MSG_21113    "Your quest is not yet complete, sir knight."
    IDS_MSG_21114    "My sincerest thanks, my lord."
    IDS_MSG_21115    "You have proved yourself a true paragon of chivalry"
    IDS_MSG_21116    "I abdicate the Duchy in your favor...."
    IDS_MSG_21117    "Oh, you can keep the Orb, by the way...."
    IDS_MSG_21118    "I didn't really think you were up to the task...."
    IDS_MSG_21119    "Rampart Coliseum"
    IDS_MSG_21120    "Enter the games, or Register as a Gladiator? [e,r,ESCAPE] "
    IDS_MSG_21121    "Enter the games? [yn] "
    IDS_MSG_21122    "You're already a gladiator...."
    IDS_MSG_21123    "We don't let Paladins into our Guild."
    IDS_MSG_21124    "We don't train no stinkin' mercs!"
    IDS_MSG_21125    "Yer too weak to train!"
    IDS_MSG_21126    "Too clumsy to be a gladiator!"
    IDS_MSG_21127    "Ok, yer now an Arena Trainee."
    IDS_MSG_21128    "Here's a wooden sword, and a shield"
    IDS_MSG_21129    "You've got 5000Au credit at the Gym."
    IDS_MSG_21130    "OK, we're arranging a match...."
    IDS_MSG_21131    "You have a challenger: "
    IDS_MSG_21132    "Let the battle begin...."
    IDS_MSG_21133    "The crowd boos your craven behavior!!!"
    IDS_MSG_21134    "You are thrown out of the Gladiator's Guild!"
    IDS_MSG_21135    "Your credit at the gym is cut off!"
    IDS_MSG_21136    "The crowd roars its approval!"
    IDS_MSG_21137    "You are the new Arena Champion!"
    IDS_MSG_21138    "You are awarded the Champion's Spear: Victrix!"
    IDS_MSG_21139    "As you are not an official gladiator,"
    IDS_MSG_21140    "you are not made Champion."
    IDS_MSG_21141    "Good fight! "
    IDS_MSG_21142    "Your prize is: "
    IDS_MSG_21143    "Au."
    IDS_MSG_21144    "You've been promoted to a stronger class!"
    IDS_MSG_21145    "You are also entitled to additional training."
END

