    IDS_MSG_21481    "You hear evil laughter...."
    IDS_MSG_21482    "A strange force spreads from the wound throughout your body..."
    IDS_MSG_21483    "You feel much more chaotic now."
    IDS_MSG_21484    "The Holy Defender screams in your hands...."
    IDS_MSG_21485    "You stagger before the sound of its rage...."
    IDS_MSG_21486    "The weapon finally quiets. It seems less holy now."
    IDS_MSG_21487    "Your opponent shies back before your holy weapon!"
    IDS_MSG_21488    "Your opponent dissipates in a harmless cloud of vapors..."
    IDS_MSG_21489    "You feel under an aegis!"
    IDS_MSG_21490    "How weird, a blessed desecrator... "
    IDS_MSG_21491    "The structure of reality cannot permit such a thing...."
    IDS_MSG_21492    "You sling your shield across a forearm."
    IDS_MSG_21493    "You feel less defended"
    IDS_MSG_21494    "You feel naked."
    IDS_MSG_21495    "You feel less vulnerable"
END

// ==================== itemf3.c ====================
