    IDS_MSG_21508    "The star gem flares with golden light!"
    IDS_MSG_21509    "Interesting, you seem to be permanently accompanied"
    IDS_MSG_21510    "by a friendly lambent glow...."
    IDS_MSG_21511    "You suddenly find yourself whisked away by some unknown force!"
