    IDS_MSG_21569    "A serious mistake!"
    IDS_MSG_21570    "The Orb of Water blasts you!"
    IDS_MSG_21571    "The Orb of Water pulses a deep green!"
    IDS_MSG_21572    "You feel wet!"
